          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "The security squad uncovers a human trafficking scheme while rescuing hostages and is tasked with escorting an undercover agent to gather evidence against a powerful criminal syndicate. Facing government corruption, deadly ambushes, and shifting loyalties, squad leader Gao Zhan and his team must fight to survive and complete their mission in a high-stakes battle of trust, sacrifice, and revenge.",
